2026-06-29T04:40:52.7237865Z 273            Same hardening for Glance's InvisibleActionTrampolineActivity.
2026-06-29T04:40:52.7238151Z 274            The library entry is singleInstance with its own taskAffinity
2026-06-29T04:40:52.7238375Z 275            but omits excludeFromRecents (unlike its sibling
2026-06-29T04:40:52.7238799Z 276            ActionTrampolineActivity which already has it). When the
2026-06-29T04:40:52.7239096Z 277            process dies before the trampoline finishes, the system can
2026-06-29T04:40:52.7239347Z 278            restore the task from Recents and replay onCreate with a
2026-06-29T04:40:52.7239963Z 279            stale Intent whose ACTION_INTENT extra is missing — which
2026-06-29T04:40:52.7240464Z 280            triggers an IllegalArgumentException ("List adapter activity
2026-06-29T04:40:52.7240794Z 281            trampoline invoked without specifying target intent"). Adding
2026-06-29T04:40:52.7241090Z 282            excludeFromRecents removes the Recents restoration vector,
