2026-06-29T04:40:53.1479838Z 54        is cancelled as soon as the user switches apps and the completion
2026-06-29T04:40:53.1480089Z 55        notification is never shown. The timer is declared as a
2026-06-29T04:40:53.1480430Z 56        mediaPlayback foreground service because Samsung One UI suppresses
2026-06-29T04:40:53.1480720Z 57        FOREGROUND_SERVICE_SPECIAL_USE notifications, preventing the
2026-06-29T04:40:53.1481024Z 58        ongoing countdown notification from appearing on those devices.
2026-06-29T04:40:53.1481165Z 59    -->
